   333	        // transparent sorting stays consistent with everything else in the scene. Must run after
   334	        // BuildGameplayNavigation has baked, or the agent has no surface to path on.
   335	        // One enemy per room beyond the entry, placed near the middle of its own room and well
   336	        // away from both doors on that room's boundaries, so the wizard never walks through a
   337	        // door into an enemy waiting on the far side. Room bounds and door centers come from
   338	        // RoomSceneCatalog: RuinedEntry Z[-26,0], BoneArchive Z[0,20], ChapelOfAsh Z[20,42],
   339	        // LowerVault Z[42,64], FinalRoom Z[64,86]; doors D1(0,0) D2(6,20) D3(-6,42) D4(4,64)
